<title>UK: Racal down, report says loses MoD contract.</title>
<headline>Racal down, report says loses MoD contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Racal Electronics Plc fell in early trading on Wednesday after a newspaper report said it lost a one billion stg contract to replace the private telephone network used by the British armed forces.</p>
<p>A report in the Independent newspaper said the government would confirm later today that British Telecom had won the contract.</p>
<p>Racal shares were down 9p at 266-1/2 by 0813 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
